## 8. Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1 — Foundation

* Implement the **Defense Scanner** and paxel indexing.
* Add metrics for error density and dependency graphing.

### Phase 2 — Healing Orchestrator

* Build concurrency-safe orchestrator with Error-Delta control.
* Register small (local) and large (remote) LLM models.

### Phase 3 — Root-Cause Engine

* Integrate stack trace parsing and dependency traversal.
* Add causal graph and signature tracking.

### Phase 4 — Memory & Dashboard

* Store fixes, metrics, and health data.
* Visualise repo health and healing performance.

### Phase 5 — Corporate Deployment

* Dockerise the system for local + cloud hybrid environments.
* Add authentication, auditing, and user roles.

